{"name":"Retro","hex":"#9bdc96","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"retro","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, or relating to, the past, past times, or the way things were.","Affecting things past; retroactive, ex post facto."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Past fashions or trends.","Abbreviation of retrorocket."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/retro"}],"entries":[{"title":"Retro (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Retro is a 2025 Indian Tamil-language romantic gangster drama film written and directed by Karthik Subbaraj. Produced by Stone Bench Creations and 2D Entertainment, the film stars Suriya and Pooja Hegde in the lead roles. In the film, Paarivel Kannan, an orphan raised by a gangster, faces betrayal and a violent cult as he searches for his true origins, fulfils a prophecy, and tries to reunite with his lost love, Rukmini."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/df/Retro_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Retro_(film)","wikidata":"Q126327867"},{"title":"Retro style","blocks":[{"text":"Retro style is imitative or consciously derivative of lifestyles, trends, or art forms from the past, including in music, modes, fashions, or attitudes. It has been argued that there is a nostalgia cycle in popular culture."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/GrupoTweedRun.jpg/330px-GrupoTweedRun.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Retro_style","wikidata":"Q1054537"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ee/Suriya_spotted_outside_Abundantia_Entertainments_office_in_Mumbai_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Suriya_spotted_outside_Abundantia_Entertainments_office_in_Mumbai_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.